#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:9
msgid ""
"Policies can be created for Groups and Clouds to require approvals for "
"actions with the built-in |morpheus| approvals engine, or via a "
"ServiceNow integration. Approvals can be configured for Provisioning and "
"Lifecycle extensions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:12
msgid "Configuring Approvals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:14
msgid "Configuring |morpheus| for Approvals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:16
msgid "To configure |morpheus| for approvals:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:18
msgid "Configure Roles for Approval access"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:19
msgid "Optionally configure a ServiceNow Integration for ServiceNow approvals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:21
msgid "Please note ServiceNow integration is not required for Internal Approvals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:23
msgid "Create approvals policies for:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:25 ../../operations/approvals.rst:79
msgid "Internal Approvals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:26
msgid "SNOW Approvals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:29
msgid "Configure Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:31
msgid ""
"Configure User Role access settings in |AdmRol| > (Role) > Operations: "
"Approvals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:33
msgid ""
"All Users with a Role applied containing Operations: Approvals set to "
"Full will have approval authority, and be able to Approve, Deny or Cancel"
" approval requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:34
msgid ""
"All Users with a Role applied that has Operations: Approvals set to Read "
"will be able to view Approval requests and history, but will not be able "
"to Approve, Deny or Cancel approval requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:35
msgid ""
"All Users with a Role applied that has Operations: Approvals set to None "
"will not have access to the Operations: Approvals section, and such will "
"not be able to see or act on approval requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/approvals.rst:36
msgid ""
"Regardless of Role settings, any instance or app provisioned by any user "
"to a group or cloud with an active Approval policy applied will require "
"approval before the instance or app will provision."
msgstr ""

